#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Xine Libraries"
msgstr "Instalação do Xine Libraries"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix building this package with ffmpeg-7.0 and later:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija a construção desse pacote com ffmpeg-7.0 e posterior:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:154
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xine-lib-&xine-lib-"
"version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xine-lib-&xine-lib-"
"version;-upstream_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, fix building this package with gcc-15.x:"
msgstr "A seguir, corrija a construção desse pacote com gcc-15.x:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xine-lib-&xine-lib-"
"version;-gcc15_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xine-lib-&xine-lib-"
"version;-gcc15_fixes-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "Next, fix building this package with ffmpeg-8:"
msgstr "A seguir, corrija construir esse pacote com ffmpeg-8:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:166
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xine-lib-&xine-lib-"
"version;-ffmpeg8.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../xine-lib-&xine-lib-"
"version;-ffmpeg8.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Xine Libraries</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Bibliotecas Xine</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:173
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --disable-vcd          \\\n"
"            --disable-w32dll       \\\n"
"            --with-external-dvdnav \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --disable-vcd          \\\n"
"            --disable-w32dll       \\\n"
"            --with-external-dvdnav \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:181
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To create the API documentation, <application>Doxygen</application> must be "
"installed and issue the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Para criar a documentação da API, o <application>Doxygen</application> "
"precisa estar instalado e emitir o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:185
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>doxygen doc/Doxyfile</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>doxygen doc/Doxyfile</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:195
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When installing, the Makefile does some additional linking.  If you do not "
"have Xorg in /usr, the LIBRARY_PATH variable needs to be defined for the "
"root user.  If using sudo to assume root, use the -E option to pass your "
"current environment variables for the install process."
msgstr ""
"Ao instalar, o Makefile faz alguma lincagem adicional. Se você não tem o "
"Xorg em /usr, a variável LIBRARY_PATH precisa estar definida para o(a) "
"usuário(a) root. Se usar sudo para assumir o root, use a opção -E para "
"passar tuas variáveis de ambiente atuais para o processo de instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the API documentation, issue the following commands as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to install it:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu a documentação da API, emita os seguintes comandos como "
"o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para "
"instalá-la:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:213
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version;/api &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/api/* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version;/api</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version;/api &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644    doc/api/* \\\n"
"                    /usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version;/api</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-vcd</parameter>: This switch is required to compile "
"<application>Xine Lib</application> without <ulink url=\"&gnu-"
"http;/vcdimager/\">VCDImager</ulink> installed.  Remove this option if you "
"have installed VCDImager."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-vcd</parameter>: Essa chave é exigida para compilar o "
"<application>Xine Lib</application> sem o <ulink url=\"&gnu-"
"http;/vcdimager/\">VCDImager</ulink> instalado. Remova essa opção se você "
"tiver instalado o VCDImager."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-external-dvdnav</parameter>: This switch is required, "
"because internal libraries cannot decrypt DVD."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-external-dvdnav</parameter>: Essa chave é exigida porque "
"as bibliotecas internas não conseguem desencriptar DVD."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-win32dll</parameter>: This switch disables building "
"Win32 support into the libraries, and fixes a compilation failure on 32-bit "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-win32dll</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita construir "
"suporte Win32 nas bibliotecas e corrige uma falha de compilação em sistemas "
"de 32 bits."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:240
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--docdir=/usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version;</parameter>: "
"This switch causes the documentation to be installed into a versioned "
"directory instead of the default <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/doc/xine-lib</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--docdir=/usr/share/doc/xine-lib-&xine-lib-version;</parameter>: "
"Essa chave faz com que a documentação seja instalada em um diretório "
"versionado, em vez do padrão <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/doc/xine-lib</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/xine-lib.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-vaapi</option>: use this switch if <xref "
"linkend=\"libva\"/> is installed and <xref linkend=\"glu\"/> is not, to "
"prevent a build failure."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-vaapi</option>: use essa chave se <xref "
"linkend=\"libva\"/> estiver instalado e <xref linkend=\"glu\"/> não estiver,"
" para evitar uma falha de construção."

